						<r3d:remarks>NIAID funding for Vectorbase as part of a Bioinformatics Resource Center ended in 2024. The repository continues to be maintained and operated by a dedicated team with the aid of community efforts and various sources of funding, including a subscription model for database and data access.
University of Notre Dame is one of four Bioinformatics Resource Centers (BRCs) awarded by NIAID to provide data, tools and services which can be accessed through publicly available sites.  Other repositories from BRCs are: EuPathDB, ViPR, IRD, PATRIC.</r3d:remarks>
